## Overview
Performs time‑series analysis on Apple stock price data. Includes data acquisition via `yfinance`, rolling‑mean trend analysis, seasonal decomposition, and optional Prophet forecasting.

## Features
- 📈 Data download with `yfinance`
- 📊 30‑day rolling mean trend
- 🌦️ Seasonal decomposition using `statsmodels`
- 🔮 Optional forecasting with Facebook Prophet (if installed)
- 📂 Generated plots: `price_plot.png`, `trend_plot.png`, `seasonality_decompose.png`, `forecast.png`

## How to Run
```bash
cd 28-Machine-Learning-TimeSeriesAnalysis
pip install -r requirements.txt
python analysis.py
```
